@startuml user_notif_liveness
hide empty description
title Reactor-owned USER_NOTIF deadline
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Pending : notification received / absolute deadline = now + 30s
Pending --> Pending : bounded poll -> Await\nidle / readiness / interrupted observation
Pending --> Claimed : Ready before deadline / CAS claim
Pending --> Expired : deadline reached / CAS claim
Claimed --> Idle : Sent / release work
Claimed --> Terminal : NotificationGone / Failed / throwing effect
Expired --> Terminal : one EPERM attempt\nSent / NotificationGone / Failed / throw
Pending --> Terminal : close / sole denial claim + cancellation
Terminal --> Terminal : late completion / dispose only
Terminal --> [*] : release session buffers + owned endpoints
note right of Pending
  Helpers own blocking preparation.
  Reactor polls earliest deadline.
  Deadline checked before and after poll.
  No callback has reply authority.
end note
note right of Claimed
  Failed/gone outcomes consume the lease.
  No second reply or fallback denial.
  Normal EINTR retries <= 8 attempts.
  Timeout denial has one attempt.
end note
@enduml
